---
import { socialLinks } from "../config/site";
---
<section id="about" class="py-20 md:py-28 px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-16 border-b border-white/[0.06]">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-8 items-start">
    <div class="lg:col-span-3 flex lg:block items-center gap-5" data-reveal>
      <img
        src="/images/gabriel-freeman.webp"
        alt="Gabriel Freeman"
        width="427"
        height="427"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
        class="w-20 h-20 md:w-28 md:h-28 lg:w-36 lg:h-36 rounded-full border border-white/[0.08] flex-shrink-0"
      />
      <span class="label block lg:mt-6">About</span>
    </div>

    <div class="lg:col-span-9 max-w-2xl" data-reveal>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-white leading-relaxed">
        I'm Gabriel Freeman. I run GLF Analytics from Los Angeles and every engagement is mine start to finish. Before GLF I worked in growth and analytics for consumer brands. The long list of what I have done since 2017 is <a href="/everything" class="underline decoration-white/30 underline-offset-4 hover:text-gold-500 hover:decoration-gold-500 transition-colors">here</a>.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-surface-400 leading-relaxed">
        Now: delivery analytics for a 34-market restaurant group and an AI rollout at a construction management firm.
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-x-8 gap-y-3 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase">
        <li><a href={socialLinks.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="text-surface-400 hover:text-gold-500 transition-colors">LinkedIn</a></li>
        <li><a href={socialLinks.substack} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="text-surface-400 hover:text-gold-500 transition-colors">Substack</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.hirethestarters.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="text-surface-400 hover:text-gold-500 transition-colors">Recognized by The Starters</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
